Autumn has finally arrived, bringing with it the traditional time for a cleanup, just as it does every year! Driven by a desire to continue giving back to the local community and support them, our team visited our partner and neighbor, OURC " D-r Zlatan Sremec", to carry out an autumn cleanup.

We believe that change begins locally and consider collaborations within local communities to be crucial. Let’s put all our hands together and preserve the cleanliness of our environment.

